flowchart TD
    I[Panorama: preserve aspect ratio; 448 x 448 input] --> E[ImageNet-initialized EfficientNet-B4]
    I --> D[Frozen DINOv2: whole image]
    I --> R[Frozen DINOv2: whole image + three regions]
    E --> EF[Global pooled convolutional features]
    D --> DF[384-dimensional image vector]
    R --> RF[Concatenate whole vector and mean regional vector: 768 features]
    EF --> EH[Train encoder and 256-unit classification head]
    DF --> DH[Fit scaler and weighted logistic regression]
    RF --> RH[Fit scaler and weighted logistic regression]
    EH --> P[Four stage probabilities]
    DH --> P
    RH --> P
